File: src/fit_field.cpp
Function: Field::GetNumComponents
One decode of the test corpus takes about 359.528 ms.
The code below currently runs at 0.911069 of the original SDK's decode time; the best found so far is 0.873172.

Rewrite this function to make decoding faster:
```cpp
FIT_UINT16 Field::GetNumComponents(void) const
{
    if ((profile == NULL) || (profileIndex >= profile->numFields))
        return 0;
    return profile->fields[profileIndex].numComponents;
}
